hrīṁ śrīṁ sarva saṃkṣobhinyādi caturdaśanityā karārśratāḥ samastāḥ 
saṃpadāya yoginyaḥ sarvasaubhāgedāyake cakre samundrā sasiddhayaḥ sāsanā 
sāyudhā saparivārā sarvopacāraiḥ damanakena śrīpādukāṃ ||
japarapāvacchāya ||
vluṁ sarva vaśaṃkarimundrā darśayet || 4 ||

<21b> pañcamāvaranasacchāya ||
