prāyaścchirta viśurdhārthakṣaṃmetā paramesvari ||
prasiddhagandhadamane najāsantānasaṃbhavaṃ ||
puraya (2) vakhavadhanetyādi ||
muranacchepucchāya || triyāñjali (3) ||
puna munamantrapalapāva dvitiyadamanacchāya ||
māsenakṣatretyādi ||
jñakivyakikaresatya mārgastha sthiti kāraṇī viṣṇusakti mahonmeṣa 
visekhāmeṣanupini ||
upanaṃ davanesantu gṛhānaparameśvari ||
āmantritosidevesyatyādi || cchāya ||

<27a> punamuramaṃtrana tṛtiyadamanacchāya ||
aiṁ klīṁ sauṁ kyilkrīṁ hskdlhrīṁ sklhriṁ turiyavijavrahmacakre odiyānapiṭhe 
śrīcaryānāthānmake śrīmahātripurasundari devi paraṃ vrahmānmaśakti 
damanake śrīpādukāṃ ||
māsanakṣatratyādi ||
nimekharupe rudrānmaśakti sphāraśarilini |
visvasaṃrambhasaṃhāraṃ saṃhāre svānmani sthite ||
supavitaṃ gṛhānemāṃ devī tripurasundali ||
āmaṃticosityādi || triyāñjalicchāya (3) ||
thvanaṃ livabhairavisakecchāya || dhyāna ||

<27b> vandhukapusvasaṃkāsaṃ catuvāhu trirocanā pāsāṃkusaśalaṃ cāpaṃ 
dhāratratibhurjāmehaṃ ||
thvamantranajaparape ||
śreṁ śklīṁ śrauṁ tripurabhairavi devī vāgvādini śrīdamanakenapādukāṃ ||
dhāra (3) || adyavārāhakalpe || māsanakṣatretyādi ||
āmantritośi devasya kāmyasvari samannutaṃ vrahmādyādi samājuktaṃ 
jogavṛndasamanvitaṃ ||
vaccharānte māhādevi śīrodhyame kṛtaṃ mayā ||
bhogāsaktyāni cintāni kṛpānitavasevayā ||
prāyaścchirtra viśurddhārtha kṣametā parameśvari || 
pasiddhagandhadamane najāsantāna saṃbhavaṃ ||

<28a> puraya (2) vakhavadhanetyādi || muramantranacchāya ||
triyāñjali (3) || thanāṭhavamārakocchāya ||
thanākaumāliyākeṃcchāya || thvanaṃli ||
gaṃgāvatāracchāya || japarapye || muranaṃdhāra (3) ||
adyavārāhakalpe māsanakṣatretyādi ||
hinātiriktayanpujā vidhānaṃ surapujitā ||
punnapātratrineta ca dhāmātirtigunātigesṛti sthityapusvasaṃhāraṃ 
vajjitekālanemite ||
śivābhinte pareśānte vimarṣodayadharmiṇi ||
gaṃgāvatārakaṃ devi damanaṃ kanmanurtamaṃ gṛdānadaṃ bhuktimukti 
sidhayasarvasiddhiya ||

<28b> aiṁ gaṃgāvatāradamanaṃ sāṃṅgāe nama || cchāya ||
triyāñjali (3) || ḍhānakāvacchāya || thavamālakocchāya ||
thvanaṃrivalivirsyahe || muravalisahāyake || 
vrahmavrahmāṇḍakhaṇḍetyādi nirvānacchāya ||
tvākamahāvarinadhunake || dhupadīpanaivyadya ||
thanā arghayācaka || saṃkhasaśataya || 
dudu arimāṃsasamayaḍhākusagvaya gvāra akṣata lūṃ tavase svānataya ||
adyavārāhakalpe māsanakṣatretyādi || vākya ||
arghoyaṃ devadevesi punnāthaṃ mamatāccītaṃ |
gṛhānāghaṃ mayādartaṃ paśidaparameśvari ||

<29a> bhairavādyāsayoginyo vaṭukaṃ gaṇamātṛkāṃ ||
cakramadhye sthihātānityāṃ namāmi parameśvari ||
vasantedāmanaṃ pūjā madanotsavakāraṇaṃ |
gṛhāṇārghamayādartaṃ sāṃgaṃ bhava tu pūjanaṃ ||
śaṃkha adhomukhayāya || prāthanāyāya ||
śrīmātatripuretrāhi paranirvāṇadāyani śrīguroścaraṇāmbhojaṃ sirddho smitva 
prasādataṃ ||
ajñānatimirāndhāhaṃ na jānāmi maheśvari ||
kramatāṃ kṛpayāsvāmi ||
kṣametākṣamyatā śive vidhihinaṃ mantrahinaṃ dravyāhinaṃ parameśvari ||
mamadinaṃ rsyadāsarsya kṣamasvaparameśvari āvāhanaṃ ca pūjāñca na 
jānāmi maheśvari ||

<29b> mamadīnaṃ rsyadāsarsya kṣamasvaparameśvarī ||
āvāhanañca pūjāñca najānāmi visarjanaṃ ||
najānāmividhiścaivatvaṃgati parameśvari ||
karmanā manasāvācā tatvanyāyagati mama ||
antaścaraṇabhutānāṃ drestvātvaṃ jagadiśvari ||
devādātāścabhoktā ca devasarvamīhaṃ jagat ||
devojayati sarvatrayodevosa maheśvarī || atragandhādi ||
thanājapa || totrayāya || namaskāla || tarpanayāya ||
avināśvabhavedena || pratisthāyāya || thvanaricupe pujā ||
pasupujāyāya ||

<30a> 'gunirvacchanādiyāya || cakārādi nyāsayāya ||
pujana || lomaviromanayāya || gāyatrikāne || samayanake ||
adyamāsanakṣatre || vākya || thanāraktavaliviya ||
ghoradaḍhastā karārārsyasurāmāṃsavari priye ||
valigṛhna tu me devī rarkapurṣvasamastakaṃ ||
matāviyāva śiranivedanayāya || khāvāne ||
thanākhācārakāva gvayacchāyake ||
samayavali saṃcchāya || thavatāṃ kāya ||
tarvana || prītipretā || dakṣināyācakre ||
karanakokāya || jāgarnajurasā cānaśayātā mārakovosapāvahaya ||

<30b> sātikunhupatyāraṃbha pujāyāya || valitāne ||
snānayāya ceta sidhatvajajomakā svānacchāya ||
sūryārghayāḍhāva mālake | pujāyāḍhāvahaya ||
pañcavali karesa kumbhapātramuradevī mumbharapūjā mālakodhṛnake ||
dhūpadīpa naivyadya jāpa stotra ||
thvatidhṛnaḍhāva vokanacchāya || prīti pretāsanasthā ||
cetasidhalamohoni sagonasvānacchāya || valithvaiyāva candrajāgayāya ||
digavodakohya devayā nilmāretayāva pūjā yāya ||
thvanaṃ lituni snānayāḍhāva nityayāya ||

<31a> devayā sakalesaṃḍha || thvanaṃ ri abhiseṣaviya ||
cetasidhalamohoni sagona snānaviya || purṇacandrayāya ||
śidhalamuḍhaviya || sākhithāya || samayaviya || tarpana || 
prītipretāsanasthā || thanācakrayāya || kuhmalapūjāviya ||
kumbhahlāya || abhisekhaviya || ukāraṃ vāyuvījaṃtyādi ||
prathamprīti pretā || dvitiya astāviṃsati ||
tṛrtiya abhināśobhavedena || anojune ānaṃdayāya ||
thanājayaṃtikāyāya || kuhmalpujāśca sthānayāya || 
trirabhojayāya ||

<31b> tarpana || abhināśvabhavedena ||
karaṃṣasavācakarajukocchoya pujāyāyamumāra || devasake vāḍhāva 
prātrajudhomuṣayāya || nilmāre pujāyāya || valilohosa vācake ||
śubhamamtrā [iti śrīurddhāmnāya pakaranadamanā rohanavidhi samāpta] ||
